      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEMPTING DASH (5) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and five placings from 15 starts. Hit the frame latest (29.74) when second at this track in a Grade 4/5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. FIRE TEARS (2) has missed the frame at his last couple but did finish in the minors in quick time three back (29.93) at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. BALANCE THE TILL (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Backburn Bluey (22.39) in a Grade 5. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Can figure in the finish. EXPEDITE (6) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
